  "content": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 1
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Automating Shipping Paperwork with On-Site AI and Computer Vision"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A fictional logistics brokerage replaced manual invoice retyping with a locally hosted extraction workflow."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "74eabb74-0db7-4431-8748-7043ccf45511"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Executive Summary"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The delivery team built a pilot that reads invoices and packing lists and fills the brokerage system for human review."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "74eabb74-0db7-4431-8748-7043ccf45511"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "41406010-3046-46b8-8929-8879a2015ce0"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Context and Challenge"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Clerks previously retyped values from paper and scanned documents, which was slow and error prone."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "74eabb74-0db7-4431-8748-7043ccf45511"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Solution and Capabilities"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The pilot pairs local processing with a reviewable extraction step."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "41406010-3046-46b8-8929-8879a2015ce0"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 3
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Local AI deployment"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "OCR and language models run on servers inside the client network."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "74eabb74-0db7-4431-8748-7043ccf45511"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 3
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Assisted extraction"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Uploaded images and PDFs are analysed and the detected fields are proposed to an operator."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "41406010-3046-46b8-8929-8879a2015ce0"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "74eabb74-0db7-4431-8748-7043ccf45511"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "sourceChunkId": "dbf7a0e8-2c01-4156-8810-a2a48d6c7968",
        "alt": "Synthetic diagram of the scan, extract, review and export steps",
        "title": "Synthetic diagram of the scan, extract, review and export steps",
        "width": "100%",
        "align": "center"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Results and Business Impact"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The only reported figure is an estimate, not a measurement."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "41406010-3046-46b8-8929-8879a2015ce0"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "bulletList",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Processing time: estimated reduction of up to 60%, with no controlled measurement."
                },
                {
                  "type": "sourceCitation",
                  "attrs": {
                    "sourceChunkId": "41406010-3046-46b8-8929-8879a2015ce0"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Scale target: an initial volume of 500 documents per day."
                },
                {
                  "type": "sourceCitation",
                  "attrs": {
                    "sourceChunkId": "41406010-3046-46b8-8929-8879a2015ce0"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Limitations and Next Steps"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Operators still choose the document type manually."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "41ce325d-e512-4fc6-8c67-2593077b357e"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Planned work covers automatic classification and ERP integration."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "41ce325d-e512-4fc6-8c67-2593077b357e"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "41406010-3046-46b8-8929-8879a2015ce0"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Conclusion"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The pilot shows that local extraction with human review is feasible; the time saving remains an estimate."
        },
        {
          "type": "sourceCitation",
          "attrs": {
            "sourceChunkId": "41406010-3046-46b8-8929-8879a2015ce0"
          }
        },
